                                                              "take":  "Damodaran is identifying a structural incentive problem, not a cyclical one, which makes it more durable and more dangerous. The real tell will be what happens to the current wave of AI-native startups: if they follow the same playbook ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â‚¬Â scale at all costs, justify losses with TAM projections ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â‚¬Â we are setting up for another reckoning. Investors in public markets should discount the \u0027we\u0027ll be profitable at scale\u0027 narrative from any company whose unit economics have never actually worked at any scale.",
